# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">HOBİLERİM VE BOŞ ZAMANLARIM (هِوَايَاتِي وَأَوْقَاتُ فَرَاغِي)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">SPOR HOBİLERİ (الْهِوَايَاتُ الرِّيَاضِيَّةُ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• كُرَةُ الْقَدَمِ / كُرَةُ السَّلَّةِ : Futbol / Basketbol</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• كُرَةُ الطَّائِرَةِ / الطَّاوِلَةِ : Voleybol / Masa tenisi</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• السِّبَاحَةُ وَالْجَرْيُ : Yüzme ve koşu</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• رُكُوبُ الْخَيْلِ / الدَّرَّاجَةِ : Binicilik / Bisiklete binme</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• الرِّمَايَةُ وَتَسَلُّقُ الْجِبَالِ : Okçuluk ve dağcılık</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fdf4ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">SANAT VE KÜLTÜR HOBİLERİ (الْهِوَايَاتُ الْفَنِّيَّةُ وَالثَّقَافِيَّةُ)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• الْقِرَاءَةُ وَالْمُطَالَعَةُ : Kitap okuma ve mütalaa</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• الرَّسْمُ وَالْخَطُّ الْعَرَبِيُّ : Resim ve Hüsnühat</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• فَنُّ الْأَبْرُو وَالتَّذْهِيبِ : Ebru ve tezhip sanatı</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• التَّصْوِيرُ الْفُوتُوغْرَافِيُّ : Fotoğrafçılık</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• لَعِبُ الشِّطْرَنْجِ وَالسَّفَرُ : Satranç oynama ve seyahat</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Tekili هِوَايَةٌ (hobi), çoğulu هِوَايَاتٌ (hobiler); boş zaman ise وَقْتُ الْفَرَاغِ tamlamasıyla ifade edilir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">MASTAR VE أَنْ + MUZÂRİ FİİL KULLANIMI (الْمَصْدَرُ وَالْمَصْدَرُ الْمُؤَوَّلُ)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">1. YOL: FİİL + AÇIK MASTAR (الْمَصْدَرُ الصَّرِيحُ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أُحِبُّ الْقِرَاءَةَ فِي الْمَكْتَبَةِ : Okumayı severim</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أُفَضِّلُ السِّبَاحَةَ فِي الصَّيْفِ : Yüzmeyi tercih ederim</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أُمَارِسُ الرِّيَاضَةَ فِي النَّادِي : Kulüpte spor yaparım</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَهْتَمُّ بِالرَّسْمِ وَالْخَطِّ : Resim ve hatla ilgilenirim</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَسْتَمْتِعُ بِرُكُوبِ الدَّرَّاجَةِ : Bisiklete binmekten keyif alırım</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">2. YOL: FİİL + أَنْ + MANSUB MUZÂRİ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• أُحِبُّ أَنْ أَقْرَأَ الْكُتُبَ : Kitap okumayı severim</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• أُفَضِّلُ أَنْ أَسْبَحَ فِي الْمَسْبَحِ : Havuzda yüzmeyi tercih ederim</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• أُرِيدُ أَنْ أَلْعَبَ كُرَةَ الْقَدَمِ : Futbol oynamak istiyorum</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• يُحِبُّ أَحْمَدُ أَنْ يَرْسُمَ اللَّوْحَاتِ : Ahmet tablo çizmeyi sever</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• تُفَضِّلُ زَيْنَبُ أَنْ تَكْتُبَ الشِّعْرَ : Zeynep şiir yazmayı tercih eder</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">«أُحِبُّ الْقِرَاءَةَ» ile «أُحِبُّ أَنْ أَقْرَأَ» cümleleri anlamca eş değerdir; أَنْ muzâri fiili fetha ile nasbeder.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">BOŞ ZAMAN DİYALOGLARI VE SORU KALIPLARI</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#ecfdf5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#065f46">TEMEL SORU KALIPLARI (أَسْئِلَةُ الْحِوَارِ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• مَا هِيَ هِوَايَتُكَ الْمُفَضَّلَةُ؟ : En sevdiğin hobin nedir?</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• مَاذَا تَفْعَلُ فِي أَوْقَاتِ الْفَرَاغِ؟ : Boş zamanlarda ne yaparsın?</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• كَيْفَ تَقْضِي عُطْلَةَ نِهَايَةِ الْأُسْبُوعِ؟ : Hafta sonunu nasıl geçirirsin?</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• أَيْنَ تُمَارِسُ هِوَايَتَكَ؟ : Hobini nerede yaparsın?</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• أَيَّ رِيَاضَةٍ تُفَضِّلُ؟ : Hangi sporu tercih edersin?</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fefce8" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#854d0e">ZAMAN DEĞERLENDİRME VE HADİS İLKELERİ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#713f12">• هِوَايَتِي الْمُفَضَّلَةُ هِيَ... : En sevdiğim hobim ...dır</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#713f12">• أَقْضِي وَقْتَ فَرَاغِي فِي... : Boş vaktimi ...da geçiririm</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#713f12">• اَلْوَقْتُ كَالسَّيْفِ : Vakit kılıç gibidir (atasözü)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#713f12">• نِعْمَتَانِ مَغْبُونٌ فِيهِمَا كَثِيرٌ مِنَ النَّاسِ : İki nimet vardır ki...</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#713f12">• اَلصِّحَّةُ وَالْفَرَاغُ : Sağlık ve boş vakit (Buhârî)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Sağlık (الصِّحَّةُ) ve boş vakit (الْفَرَاغُ), faydalı hobilerle değerlendirilmesi gereken iki büyük nimettir.</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
